{"body_markdown":"## 研究问题与阅读顺序\n先读第1轮顺序误差，再读第2轮Kahan反例，最后读第3轮30种排列复验；三篇L1均包含输入、公式、实测中间量、结果表和PNG。\n\n## 已完成证据\n原3个Run保持原位；新研究目录内另存首次绘图失败与后续成功复核。150个结果一致，111组显式算法轨迹，采样配方30组一致。L2保留观察、选择及执行失败。\n\n## 下一步\n分别建立非整数、极端指数、跨平台和计时试验，不凭本组样本推断总体概率或普适正确性。原经验和地图历史保留；本修订只是证据组织更新，未人工认可。","change_reason":"在真实旧HEAD基础上新增修订：补齐L1与L2并绑定本次复核；保留原历史与限制。","content_hash":"bcd283e06199f04b958e549c03d8be7879393bdd054491c6449c5d968e9ea852","created_at":"2026-09-08T20:15:35.156441Z","created_by":{"id":"summation-research-assistant","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","数值稳定性","map"],"kind":"map","level":"L4","owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"conflict_refs":[],"coverage":{"missing":["非整数、溢出和性能未测"],"owner_ids":["RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","RUN-20260908T201214Z-D0AB308F66AD","RUN-20260908T201228Z-A0980824DC18","RUN-20260908T201240Z-90107A617CF8","RUN-20260908T215458Z-04C7D84D40D8","RUN-20260908T214955Z-2273015D2CEF"],"source_versions":[{"locator":"summary and rows","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"cdb1f9e4f0580d5baaea4a09416f75801e6c5d01eab96c601ded00a28e31134d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R01","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"summary and rows","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"f5ef99109b146631abf1fc7256fc62287cbf125c6535ba097da4440570fc8247","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R02","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"summary and rows","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"693058d77bb3ed61e94535369bbfa4d74b6a2ed7f406a8af0b5782a0dc4fa7ef","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"739d2ce2c6922dc7ce74dfea9ac22d987dd6b8d353484e70c615fc96d2f22074","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-TRACE-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8fc77120e5495b853becd8d160ae84f8c135318eec5dda1f8108b68dd5dfc52d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-SAMPLING-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"}]},"goal_refs":[],"missing_refs":[],"next_steps":["非整数与极端指数测试","跨平台复